        "nobel_worthiness": "Antisense correction of SMN2 splicing converted a precise RNA mechanism into a life-changing treatment for spinal muscular atrophy.",
        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett represent the central mechanistic and antisense-therapeutic contributions.",
        "maturity": "Clinical efficacy is established, and the work has validated a broader therapeutic strategy for RNA splicing disorders.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The clinical translation involved substantial additional contributions beyond the two proposed laureates."
