      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "GLP-1 physiology enabled a major therapeutic class with profound effects on diabetes and obesity medicine.",
        "attribution": "Holst, Mojsov, and Drucker provide a coherent three-person account spanning identification of the hormone, its physiological significance, and therapeutic development.",
